    "order": 163,
    "anchor": "8-deploy-armies-3",
    "summary": "Starting with the Defender, players take turns setting up units singly, each wholly within their own deployment zone; units in **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)** are left out. Then:\n\n- After setting up a **TITANIC** unit, skip your next placement.\n- Once one player has set up all their units, the other sets up all their remaining units.",
